/* Movie, event and food offers for credit and debit cards on BookMyShow, District and PVR INOX.
 * This file is the only place offer data lives. Edit it, then run:
 *   pnpm build:movies   (validates every record, then bakes the lists into movie-offers.html)
 *   pnpm test:movies    (validation + savings-calculator tests)
 *
 * SOURCING RULES
 * - Official sources only: the bank's own page, notice or T&C, the platform's own offer page, or the offer terms
 *   inside the platform's app (Abhishek's screenshots, copies in /mnt/project-files/movie-offers/district-app/).
 * - Never invent a cap, limit, code or date. Leave a field out rather than guess. A missing `end` means the source
 *   gave no end date, not that the offer runs forever.
 * - `status`:
 *     verified  current official terms read in full on `verified` (source.type bank, platform or notice)
 *     app       terms read inside the platform app on `verified`
 *     listed    officially advertised, full terms not read: show the headline only, add no figures
 *     upcoming  announced, `start` is in the future
 *     expired   kept for history; never shown as active (offers past `end` also drop off automatically)
 *     needs     conflicting, incomplete or outdated; hidden from the page
 * - `accessed` is when the source was last opened; `verified` is when its full terms were checked. A source URL on
 *   its own never makes an offer verified.
 *
 * RECORD FIELDS (all optional unless marked *)
 *   id*        unique kebab-case id
 *   platform*  bms | district | pvr
 *   issuer*    key of `issuers` below
 *   cards*     card variants, without the bank name ("Sapphiro", not "ICICI Sapphiro")
 *   cardType*  credit | debit | prepaid
 *   network    visa | mastercard | rupay | amex | diners, only when the offer is limited to that network
 *   kind*      bogo | percent | flat | free (free tickets) | cashback | rewards (points) | voucher
 *   scope      "welcome" for one-time welcome gifts (left out of the savings calculator)
 *   category*  any of movies, events, activities, fnb
 *   benefit*   one-line headline, in plain words
 *   percent    discount or cashback %           flat       flat ₹ off per booking
 *   capTxn     max ₹ off per booking            capTicket  max ₹ per free ticket
 *   freeTickets free tickets per use (bogo: per booking, default 1; free: per period)
 *   tiers      [{spend, freeTickets}] for spend-tiered free tickets
 *   monthCap   max ₹ benefit per month          quarterCap max ₹ per quarter
 *   uses       {count, per}: per = month | billing-cycle | quarter | half-year | year | campaign
 *   limitText  usage limit in words, when it doesn't fit `uses`
 *   minTickets minimum tickets per booking       minAmount  minimum booking value in ₹
 *   spend      {amount, period, text}: period = prev-month | month | billing-cycle | prev-quarter | half-year | year
 *   days       show/booking days, 0 = Sunday … 6 = Saturday
 *   channel    online | counter | both           cinemas    cinema restriction in words
 *   code       promo code                        start, end ISO dates (Asia/Kolkata), inclusive
 *   bins       card BINs (first 6 to 9 digits of the card number) the terms limit the offer to, exactly as printed
 *   source*    {url, type: bank | platform | app | notice, label}
 *   accessed*  ISO date the source was opened    verified   ISO date full terms were checked
 *   terms      secondary conditions, shown under "Full terms"
 *   changes    [{date, text, url}] announced changes, shown on the offer
 *   reviews    review slugs on avhishek.in (card-reviews/<slug>)
 */
